---
import Button from './Button.astro';
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="border-y border-oat/60 bg-oat-light/60">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <SectionHeading eyebrow="About">Designer first, but fluent in the rest</SectionHeading>
      <p class="text-lg text-ink/80">
        I've spent the last eight years in small product teams where the designer
        also writes the research plan, argues the roadmap, and sits in on sprint
        planning. I'm moving to Switzerland for the long term — not trying it out —
        and I'm looking for a team that treats design as part of how decisions get
        made, not how they get decorated.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <Button href="/about/" variant="ghost">More about me</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
